      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\"City Development Project\" shall mean a project developed subject to a Project Agreement for the purpose of improvement or development of real property, economic development, job retention or growth, or other similar purposes where the project: (a) is expected to be larger than 100,000 square feet, or, in the case of a residential project, larger than 100 units; and (b) has received or is expected to receive Financial Assistance.",
